\Delta S = \sum \left( n_f \Delta S_f \right) - \sum \left( n_p \Delta S_p \right)
\]

where:
- \(n_f\) is the number of product molecules
- \(\Delta S_f\) is the standard entropy change of formation for the product
- \(n_p\) is the number of product molecules
- \(\Delta S_p\) is the standard entropy of formation for the product

