Lattice Energy = (1 /4πε) * (Z1 * Z2 * e^2) / (r) * (1 - 3 * a)

The given bond-Levig equation constant (2.21 x 10^-19 J nm) is a combination of the constants in the equation above.

Lattice Energy = (2.21 x 10^-19 J nm) * (Z1 * Z2) / (r)

