2. The solution becomes clear, indicating the formation of soluble products.  

The fully ionized equation for the reaction is:  
\[ \text{H(C₇H₅O₂)} (s) + \text{OH}^- (aq) \rightarrow \text{C₇H₅O₂}^- (aq) + \text{H}_2\text{O} (l) \]  

