14 = x - \frac{23}{15}x
\]
Simplify the right side:
\[
14 = \frac{15}{15}x - \frac{23}{15}x
\]
\[
14 = \frac{2}{15}x
\]
Multiply both sides by \( \frac{15}{2} \):
