\]

The transformation of the components of \( \mathbf{J} \) and \( \mathbf{E} \) under a rotation is:

\[
J'_i = L_{ij} J_j, \quad E'_i = L_{ij} E_j
\]

Substituting these into the transformation of \( \mathbf{j} \):

\[
