   \[
   Q_{\text{gas}} = m_{\text{gas}} c_{\text{gas}} \Delta T = m_{\text{gas}} \times 1.005 \times (1100 - 550) = 552.75 m_{\text{gas}} \text{ kJ}
   \]
   The entropy change of the gas is:
   \[
   S_{\text{gas}} = \frac{Q_{\text{gas}}}{T_{\text{gas}}} = \frac{m_{\text{gas}} \times 1.005 \times 552.75}{T_{\text{gas}}} = \frac{552.75 m_{\text{gas}}}{T_{\text{gas}}} \text{ kJ/K}
   \]
